#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NetHack 5.0  chinese.500
#
# Chinese localization build flag.  Include it from a hints file's
# HINTSINCLNAMES list (macOS.500 and linux.500 already do that); remove
# "chinese" from that list to build the plain English version.
#
# ZHLANG enables Chinese text throughout the game:
#   - item names/descriptions from objects_zh.h
#   - monster names from monsters_zh.h
#   - Chinese-translated source strings (TR() macro / #ifdef ZHLANG guards)
#   - the *_zh help and data files
#
# This file is the only place that adds -DZHLANG.  Do not add it to
# compiler.500: without this include the build must stay English.
#

CFLAGS += -DZHLANG
